2,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"With no clue how he came to be imprisoned, drugged and tortured for 15 years, a desperate man seeks revenge on his captors.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":658083,\"title\":\"Acting with Sharks\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cfBlE6q6UueZvoMCiZD6AifZRmh.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ukmdr3M99iNTcos86kTA5LtjqGC.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2013,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Aspiring actors take a workshop to learn to act with live sharks but bite off more than they can chew when the instructor turns out to be crazy.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":479647,\"title\":\"Les Fabuleux Pouvoirs de l'hypnose\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9GZj8Zslq72LB1nX9uOdEGpjpZG.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ek9rphvjW4IR7urMHmTkxdtPhjx.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"More and more doctors and surgeons are using hypnosis as a supplement to anesthesia during surgery. Hypnosis is also gaining increasing recognition among conventional physicians, especially for anesthesia and pain treatment. Can it also help with psychological stress disorders such as trauma, phobias, addiction, depression or burnout?\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":167,\"title\":\"K-PAX\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tafXZX0I6rso7EyoEzfygfTqxq6.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/v8xav2JYqqn3O14s0PR4UgWBz95.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2001,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Prot is a patient at a mental hospital who claims to be from a far away planet. His psychiatrist tries to help him, only to begin to doubt his own explanations.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Drama\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":291805,\"title\":\"Now You See Me 2\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/A81kDB6a1K86YLlcOtZB27jriJh.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oFQilRMEq6yQbtMPxIYWpXeQ5ZN.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"One year after outwitting the FBI and winning the public’s adulation with their mind-bending spectacles, the Four Horsemen resurface only to find themselves face to face with a new enemy who enlists them to pull off their most dangerous heist yet.\",\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":273197,\"title\":\"The Great Hypnotist\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hqfKwoVMe3WCtTWWv2rIW6Oe05X.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lENcfQLWuvZFDm04mBdnyGZd1dn.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The famous psychologist Xu Ruining has a raising career, when he met the troublesome patient Ren Xiaoyan. The meeting is not easy as feeble-looking Ren is point by point against him.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Drama\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":2779,\"title\":\"The Curse of the Jade Scorpion\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mfvWefUp09oaLLxb8KhsvUYi7mX.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vq4vYFV0TWCCovAFLcdZLCo4Qud.jpg\",\"rating\":6.6,\"year\":2001,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"CW Briggs is a veteran insurance investigator, with many successes. Betty Ann Fitzgerald is a new employee in the company he works for, with the task of reorganizing the office. They don't like each other - or at least that's what they think. During a night out with the rest of the office employees, they go to watch Voltan, a magician who secretly hypnotizes both of them.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Crime\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":22824,\"title\":\"The Fourth Kind\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vfnsGUwurUQqlpvArBvUVc9rYXa.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4Ue8De8AXVrSWvFQMzmoJQn4Pxe.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Since the 1960s, a disproportionate number of the population in and around Nome, Alaska, have gone missing. Despite FBI investigations, the disappearances remain a mystery. Dr. Abigail Tyler, a psychologist, may be on the verge of blowing the unsolved cases wide open when, during the course of treating her patients, she finds evidence of alien abductions.\",\"genres\":[\"Mystery\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":27374,\"title\":\"Lake Mungo\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5IaGu8r0t6bBaydkR6z9l9tJsCg.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5eaS62YjA5Z7WPcf4quyZa5VpeO.jpg\",\"rating\":6.1,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After 16-year-old Alice Palmer drowns at a local dam, her family experiences a series of strange, inexplicable events centered in and around their home. Unsettled, the Palmers seek the help of a psychic and parapsychologist, who discovers that Alice led a secret, double life. At Lake Mungo, Alice's secret past emerges.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":2588,\"title\":\"Chaotic Ana\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/49HVU5cpbP5aVIDPfudwYCrLcFo.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/j5VTKDRMDqCmQj4zK8TS0JQwQ9y.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Ana, a teenager artist, is raised in Ibiza by her German father Klaus in a naturalist lifestyle. She meets Justine, who invites her to move to Madrid and get an artistic education and financial support. Ana befriends Linda, meets the problematic Said, a Saharawi youngster, and later she is hypnotized by Anglo, who opens a door to her memories and past lives.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"JeTYD4CZz3Y\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"fnndxKV3cwc\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"3mWglWbcPfQ\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\"